  {
   "id": "a-night-on-the-farm-266431@post-2024-07-02",
   "gameId": "a-night-on-the-farm-266431",
   "displayName": "Patch Notes for July 2, 2024",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2024-07-02T22:15:10.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Finally, the patch you've been waiting for...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mouse Sensitivity is fixed! Meaning, when playing the game with Mouse + Keyboard, you can now move the camera WAY faster than before.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "NOTES",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The camera's movement speed will feel different depending on if you toggle the Look Speed Option while using Keyboard + Mouse or Gamepad. Meaning, \"5\" while using Gamepad will be a lot slower than \"5\" while using Mouse + Keyboard.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Make sure to update the Look Speed setting while playing with the device you want affected. (The settings get applied when you leave the pause menu.)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "When playing with Mouse + Keyboard you'll probably want the \"Look Acceleration\" setting at 9 or 10.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Look acceleration is how quickly the camera speed goes from 0 to the Look Speed setting. Higher acceleration makes camera movement very snappy and responsive. This setting is mostly useful for playing with Gamepad.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Huge thank you to those who brought this to my attention in the Discussion thread. Sorry it took me so long to figure this out. (I'm one guy working on the game.)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As always, thanks a bunch for the amazing support! Happy Farming!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
