  {
   "id": "a-night-on-the-farm-266431@post-2024-02-21",
   "gameId": "a-night-on-the-farm-266431",
   "displayName": "Patch Notes for February 21, 2024",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2024-02-21T18:28:27.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone! Just a small update today. There haven't been any major bugs reported in a few days, so right now I'm just making some final tweaks to the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fading in to the \"Car Scene\" is now slightly more cinematic. While I was digging around in that code, I fixed a small (imperceivable, even) bug related to loading into that area for the first time.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I also updated some code related to \"Cursor Lock\" when \"focused\" on the game window versus other OS windows, but that should not change the functionality for Windowed gameplay. (I wanted to mention this one in case anyone feels they're finding bugs they didn't used to.)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
